# state: any   (classifier-path benchmark opening; #433 step 6c)
# Phantom Crash (504C0001), classifier-path benchmark (#433): drive generic
# replaces the blind opening and marks gameplay itself once play is
# confirmed. Mech combat: move forward, turn, fire -- never START.
drive generic 300 mark
axis LY min
repeat forever {
    axis LX max
    wait 1.0
    axis LX mid
    wait 1.0
    axis LX min
    wait 1.0
    axis LX mid
    axis RT max
    wait 0.6
    axis RT min
    wait 1.0
}
